  "description": {
    "raw": "You imbue the subject with divine diplomacy skills. The creature gets a +2 competence bonus on a single Diplomacy or Intimidate check. It must choose to use the bonus before making the roll to which it applies.",
    "search_text": "\"you imbue the subject with divine diplomacy skills. the creature gets a +2 competence bonus on a single diplomacy or intimidate check. it must choose to use the bonus before making the roll to which it applies.\"",
